cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Code for: Arguing both sides changes cooperation by less than the effect of communication itself: a preregistered null result, with exploratory bounds on peer rewards"
abstract: "oTree 5.10.4 code of a lab experiment with 148 university students in 74 fixed pairs at REBEL, Universidad del Rosario, Bogota (26 and 29 November and 2 December 2024): an argument exchange on a moral dilemma about reporting illegal pollution under armed threats, a paid ranking of four arguments, and four one-shot conflict games with the same partner, followed by Davis's Interpersonal Reactivity Index and a background survey. Preregistration AsPredicted #201318. Contains no participant data."
